<view class="page operations-page"><view class="page-title">服务运行概况。</view><view class="subtitle">查看服务配置、待处理记录与最近维护结果。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取运行情况…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新读取</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!isAdmin}}" class="empty"><view class="section-title">仅运营者可以查看</view><view>这里展示社区的运行情况。</view></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo-label">本机演示 · 仅展示本机记录，不代表云服务已就绪</view><view class="card config-card"><view class="section-title">服务配置</view><view wx:for="{{configurations}}" wx:key="name" class="health-row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="status-label {{item.ready ? 'ready' : ''}}">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="health-note">配置状态来自服务端。维护入口可用不代表定时任务已配置，实际执行情况以最近维护记录为准。</view></view><view class="queue-grid"><view wx:for="{{queues}}" wx:key="name" class="queue-card"><view class="queue-count">{{item.value}}</view><view>{{item.name}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{countsLimited}}" class="health-note">部分计数达到读取上限，显示的是当前已读取数量，实际记录可能更多。</view><view class="card maintenance-card"><view class="section-title">最近维护</view><view class="health-row"><text>最近执行</text><text>{{maintenance.lastRun}}</text></view><view class="health-row"><text>最近成功</text><text>{{maintenance.lastSuccess}}</text></view><view class="maintenance-result {{maintenance.failed ? 'failed' : ''}}">{{maintenance.result}}</view><view wx:if="{{maintenance.errorCode}}" class="health-note">错误记录：{{maintenance.errorCode}}</view></view><button class="btn btn-secondary refresh-health" bindtap="refresh">刷新运行情况</button><view class="health-note">刷新会更新当前状态；定期维护需要在服务端配置调度。</view></block></view>
